0-for-3-attempts to **valid on the first attempt**. No auto-repair
anywhere (wrapper normalization only, logged).

**#127 the benchmark** — `bench_schema_models.py` shells the SAME C++
validator through the CLI (one contract everywhere) over a fixed
corpus. Measured results:

{table}
Measured winner: **{winner}** — which already IS the configured dialogue
model, so generation shares the one client (documented in llm.cfg; a
